WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:10.509
Drag a session: before you drop it,
you see what it would clash with.

2
00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:16.511
Magenta: moved away from its
booking – it needs rebooking.

3
00:00:16.611 --> 00:00:22.902
Nothing is saved yet – Vista
writes all changes at once.

4
00:00:23.002 --> 00:00:26.904
Click a box for its details.

5
00:00:27.004 --> 00:00:32.907
Stofa: pick another room – free
rooms for that time come first.

6
00:00:33.007 --> 00:00:37.460
Vista: the move becomes
Núverandi lausn.

7
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:43.461
Remove one session, or the whole
course, from this stundatafla.

8
00:00:43.561 --> 00:00:48.463
Litur: the course's colour
in this stundatafla.

9
00:00:48.563 --> 00:00:54.465
Festa tíma: Besta will not move
this session (it may change room).

10
00:00:54.565 --> 00:01:03.134
Clashes are listed by kind,
with the course they clash with.

11
00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:09.136
Meta lausn re-counts the clashes,
with the same numbers Besta uses.
